{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Planet Pioneers",
    "steam_appid": 2920910,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920910/extras/2e6c8cffc3cdd0d7b1b4ed6d6f3f5a3e.webp?t=1739803307\" width=596 height=56 /></span><br><br>Sit back, relax and prepare new planets for humanity in Planet Pioneers.<br>Place tiles strategically, fulfill various settler requests and keep planet pollution low along the way. When the settlers are satisfied, you can hand the planet over and continue with the next one. Each planet has their own challenges to overcome, but all of them are peaceful without any time pressure applied.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920910/extras/6ea9723f654baf9b6fd50d7817a6f8ba.poster.avif?t=1739803307\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920910/extras/6ea9723f654baf9b6fd50d7817a6f8ba.webm?t=1739803307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920910/extras/6ea9723f654baf9b6fd50d7817a6f8ba.mp4?t=1739803307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Planet Pioneers is intended as a casual game which you can touch occassionally. All comes down to your building placement decisions. In the beginning, this is still quite easy. The difficulty increases over time by having ever-increasing planet sizes, more building types and higher demands from your settlers. At the end you get a highscore which you can try to beat in the next round.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920910/extras/0ab746bed2439327171f161b9a48f31c.webp?t=1739803307\" width=596 height=56 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Planet Pioneers offers</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Strategic tile placement on planets<br></li><li>Endless procedural planets with individual difficulties to play on<br></li><li>Quests by settlers for extra points<br></li><li>Relaxing and calming gameplay<br></li><li>Good replay value, can be picked up from time to time, trying to beat your last highscore</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Planet Pioneers does NOT offer</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>4X Strategy<br></li><li>Detailed resource management<br></li><li>(Space) combat / armies<br></li><li>Multiplayer<br></li><li>Lootboxes, battlepasses and other money-draining stuff</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920910/extras/2e6c8cffc3cdd0d7b1b4ed6d6f3f5a3e.webp?t=1739803307\" width=596 height=56 /></span><br><br>Sit back, relax and prepare new planets for humanity in Planet Pioneers.<br>Place tiles strategically, fulfill various settler requests and keep planet pollution low along the way. When the settlers are satisfied, you can hand the planet over and continue with the next one. Each planet has their own challenges to overcome, but all of them are peaceful without any time pressure applied.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920910/extras/6ea9723f654baf9b6fd50d7817a6f8ba.poster.avif?t=1739803307\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920910/extras/6ea9723f654baf9b6fd50d7817a6f8ba.webm?t=1739803307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920910/extras/6ea9723f654baf9b6fd50d7817a6f8ba.mp4?t=1739803307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Planet Pioneers is intended as a casual game which you can touch occassionally. All comes down to your building placement decisions. In the beginning, this is still quite easy. The difficulty increases over time by having ever-increasing planet sizes, more building types and higher demands from your settlers. At the end you get a highscore which you can try to beat in the next round.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920910/extras/0ab746bed2439327171f161b9a48f31c.webp?t=1739803307\" width=596 height=56 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Planet Pioneers offers</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Strategic tile placement on planets<br></li><li>Endless procedural planets with individual difficulties to play on<br></li><li>Quests by settlers for extra points<br></li><li>Relaxing and calming gameplay<br></li><li>Good replay value, can be picked up from time to time, trying to beat your last highscore</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Planet Pioneers does NOT offer</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>4X Strategy<br></li><li>Detailed resource management<br></li><li>(Space) combat / armies<br></li><li>Multiplayer<br></li><li>Lootboxes, battlepasses and other money-draining stuff</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Planet Pioneers is a relaxing building and puzzle game where you prepare new planets for settlers. Build tiles strategically, fulfill quests for your settlers, keep pollution low and enable new buildings along the way. Shape the planet as you wish until it\u2019s time to move on to your next challenge.",
